SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                1000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  500
PrintEvery                    100

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                      12.8
CutOffCoulomb                  12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

ComputeEnergyHistogram        yes
WriteEnergyHistogram          yes
ComputeNumberOfMoleculesHistogram yes
WriteNumberOfMoleculesHistogram yes

Framework 0
FrameworkName framework
UnitCells 2 2 1
HeliumVoidFraction 0.5
ExternalTemperature 273.0
ExternalPressure 1e5

Component 0 MoleculeName           nitrogen
            MoleculeDefinition     local
            TranslationProbability 1.0
            RotationProbability    1.0
            ReinsertionProbability 1.0
            SwapProbability        1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 0

